# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/security

## Purpose
Owns Android-specific security helpers and policy integration for the LumiNet application.

## Contents
Contains Kotlin/Java security utilities, validation/policy adapters, and platform-facing protection logic.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Used by Android application components that cross trust, credential, storage, or platform-security boundaries.

## Invariants
Security decisions fail closed, secrets are not persisted or logged outside approved stores, and untrusted inputs are validated before privileged or network-sensitive use.